<title>USA: Mizar gets Northrop Grumman order.</title>
<headline>Mizar gets Northrop Grumman order.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mizar Inc said it reveived a $500,000 order from Northrop Grumman Corp for its multiprocessor single board computers.</p>
<p>The computers will be used in the development of a prototype sonar system for the U.S. Navy for submarine detection.</p>
<p>Mizar supplies multiprocessor digital signal processing technology.</p>
